[2025-05-03 16:02:56] L.: The source code release of QModem 4.51, 
an MS-DOS telecommunications program authored by John Friel III 
(1960–2024). This source snapshot reflects the state of QModem 
"Test-Drive" edition, version 4.51, as it existed in early 1992. The 
release is presented in the hope it may prove valuable as a historical 
artifact, for telecommunications enthusiasts, retrocomputing hobbyists, 
or anyone interested in the inner workings of a classic DOS comms 
package.
